**/node_modules
**/coverage
**/data/*.sqlite

# Gitignored artifacts that would otherwise reach the context unseen by
# `saf-docker inputs` (images rebuild their own outputs).
**/dist/types
**/data/*.sqlite-shm
**/data/*.sqlite-wal
**/saf-workflow-status.json
**/saf-workflow-status.error.json
**/saf-workflow-prompt.log

# Do not copy local env / credential files into images.
**/.env
**/.env.local
